    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say things get better but it just feels like a lie people tell to keep you going. like, why am i even trying to keep up with this cycle if the end result is just more debt and more burnout? it feels so irrational to keep fighting something that's clearly meant to break me. it's like i'm just stuck in this loop and there's no actual way out.",
